Receipt:.local\full-catalogue-20261010\publication.json.

Keep Cakes we've made as a heading above six separate top-spiral notebooks:
Birthday Cakes, Tea cakes, Cream cakes, Decorated cakes, Doll cakes and Chocolates.
Birthday Cakes replaces Ice cream and is first, as the owner later requested.
Each opens with a zoom directly to photos. Weight information appears once as a
plain cake-weight line before the cover grid, never inside a notebook. Multi-page
books turn upward using buttons, arrow keys or a bottom-edge drag.

This supersedes the earlier single twelve-cake page. It does not authorize
inventing category/product facts, silently publishing unreviewed photographs or
resetting the current session's exhausted image-view budget.

